    "message": "No assessment or plan was documented for this visit. Given pregnancy on TDF/3TC/DTG with rising creatinine, haemoglobin of 10.8 g/dL, and approaching TPT eligibility, a documented plan addressing renal monitoring, anaemia evaluation, and TB prevention is needed. The patient is also due for routine antenatal care coordination. Hb of 10.8 g/dL may reflect physiological haemodilution of pregnancy or iron deficiency; ferrous sulfate is already prescribed.",
